# Gimnasio Veneno (C5a, contract 47), 13 x 15, interior. column = i, row = j. The user's mock "Gimnasio Veneno": a dark DOJO with paper screens (`shoji_j` / `shoji_i` on the two back sides) and a floor of BIG LIGHT
# TATAMI mats (2 x 2 tiles: `tatami_<i%2><j%2>`, never small tiles). has INVISIBLE walls: the whole floor is one tatami and a maze of `solid=yes` cells (the same ground tile, no art) is the only thing between the
# door and KAI. The maze is a perfect maze of 6 x 6 cells (the cells are the odd tiles, the walls the even ones; the entrance is the gap of the south wall below cell (2,5)); the path to Kai has 24 cells, the four disciples
# stand at the ends of straight side branches and look back along them (a world-axis facing: their art is the static 8-direction one), so they see the hero when he steps on the junction; Kai (a script NPC, the camera cuts
# to him) waits in the dead end at the top. A win: flag 84 (Medalla Toxina, builtin `badge_toxina`, the card's 5th badge), Disc 06 (flag 832).
@map gimnasio_ambar
@size 13 15
@interior yes
@flag kai_disc 832         # Kai's Disc 06 was handed over (a full bag keeps it clear)
@bg 0
@fill tatami_00
@spawn door 5 13 N
@legend
  .  tile=tatami_00
  a  tile=none object=shoji_j
  b  tile=none object=shoji_i
  c  tile=tatami_11 npc=medium_s id=t2 face=SE trainer=ninja_g2 range=4 text=tr.ninja_g2.pre after=tr.ninja_g2.after
  d  tile=tatami_01
  e  tile=tatami_11
  f  tile=tatami_01 solid=yes
  g  tile=tatami_11 npc=kai id=kai face=SW script=kai
  h  tile=tatami_10 solid=yes
  i  tile=tatami_00 solid=yes
  j  tile=tatami_10
  k  tile=tatami_11 npc=aprendiz_s id=t3 face=SE trainer=ninja_g3 range=4 text=tr.ninja_g3.pre after=tr.ninja_g3.after
  l  tile=tatami_11 npc=aprendiz_s id=t1 face=NE trainer=ninja_g1 range=4 text=tr.ninja_g1.pre after=tr.ninja_g1.after
  m  tile=tatami_11 npc=cazabichos_s id=t4 face=NE trainer=ninja_g4 range=4 text=tr.ninja_g4.pre after=tr.ninja_g4.after
  n  tile=tatami_11 object=candle
  o  tile=tatami_01 object=candle
  p  tile=tatami_00
  q  tile=mat
@grid
  aaaaaaaaaaaaa
  bcdededefgdef
  bhihijijihiji
  bededefedefef
  bjihihihijiji
  bedefkdededef
  bjijihihihiji
  befefededefef
  bjijijihijiji
  blfededefefmf
  bjihihihijiji
  bedefededefef
  bhihijihihihi
  dndndedeoednd
  pjpjpqqjpjpjp
@warp q -> ciudad_ambar spawn=gym_door
# Kai. The camera cuts to him; his challenge, the fight (trainer kai: Smogkeg 37, Slickslime 39, Smogkeg 37, Twinkeg 43); a win = his speech, the Medalla Toxina (flag 84, the trainer card's 5th badge,
# a poison drop), what it is, then Disc 06 (a full bag keeps kai_disc clear and he hands it over the next time you talk to him). A loss is the blackout. Afterwards a last line.
@script kai npc
    jf badge_toxina after
    npc_face_hero kai
    cam_npc kai
    say gym.kai.pre
    battle 119 0
    jv 0 1 won
    blackout
    end
  won:
    say gym.kai.win
    setf badge_toxina
    say gym.kai.badge
    say gym.kai.about
    call kai_gift
    cam_hero
    end
  after:
    npc_face_hero kai
    cam_npc kai
    jf kai_disc said
    call kai_gift
    cam_hero
    end
  said:
    say gym.kai.after
    cam_hero
@end
@script kai_gift called
    say gym.kai.disc
    give_item disc_06 1
    jv 0 0 full
    item_var 0 disc_06
    say gl.gift
    setf kai_disc
    say gym.kai.disc_about
    end
  full:
    say gl.found.full
@end
